          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>For simple linear regression, $se(\\hat\\beta_1) = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\hat\\sigma^2}{S_{xx}}}$, so $\\hat\\sigma^2 = se(\\hat\\beta_1)^2 \\times S_{xx} = (4.75)^2 \\times 1475 = 22.5625 \\times 1475 = 33{,}279.69$. The estimator of the variance is $\\hat\\sigma^2 = MSE = \\dfrac{SSE}{n-2}$, and here $n = 10$ so $n-2 = 8$. Hence $SSE = 33{,}279.69 \\times 8 = 266{,}237.5 \\approx 266238$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Trong hồi quy tuyến tính đơn, $se(\\hat\\beta_1) = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\hat\\sigma^2}{S_{xx}}}$, nên $\\hat\\sigma^2 = se(\\hat\\beta_1)^2 \\times S_{xx} = (4.75)^2 \\times 1475 = 22.5625 \\times 1475 = 33{,}279.69$. Ước lượng phương sai là $\\hat\\sigma^2 = MSE = \\dfrac{SSE}{n-2}$, ở đây $n = 10$ nên $n-2 = 8$. Do đó $SSE = 33{,}279.69 \\times 8 = 266{,}237.5 \\approx 266238$.</p></div>"
