          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The sample proportions are $\\hat p_1 = 480/600 = 0.80$ and $\\hat p_2 = 300/400 = 0.75$. Under $H_0: p_1 = p_2$ we pool: $\\hat p = \\dfrac{480+300}{600+400} = \\dfrac{780}{1000} = 0.78$, so $\\hat p(1-\\hat p) = 0.78 \\times 0.22 = 0.1716$. The standard error is $\\sqrt{0.1716\\left(\\dfrac{1}{600} + \\dfrac{1}{400}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.1716 \\times 0.0041667} = \\sqrt{0.000715} = 0.02674$. Hence $z_0 = \\dfrac{0.80 - 0.75}{0.02674} = \\dfrac{0.05}{0.02674} = 1.87$. It is positive because Maricopa (the larger proportion) is taken first.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Các tỷ lệ mẫu là $\\hat p_1 = 480/600 = 0.80$ và $\\hat p_2 = 300/400 = 0.75$. Dưới $H_0: p_1 = p_2$ ta gộp: $\\hat p = \\dfrac{480+300}{600+400} = \\dfrac{780}{1000} = 0.78$, nên $\\hat p(1-\\hat p) = 0.78 \\times 0.22 = 0.1716$. Sai số chuẩn là $\\sqrt{0.1716\\left(\\dfrac{1}{600} + \\dfrac{1}{400}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.1716 \\times 0.0041667} = \\sqrt{0.000715} = 0.02674$. Do đó $z_0 = \\dfrac{0.80 - 0.75}{0.02674} = \\dfrac{0.05}{0.02674} = 1.87$. Giá trị dương vì hạt Maricopa (tỷ lệ lớn hơn) được lấy trước.</p></div>"
